WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.043
Recordly screen recording.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.300
Recording continues while a chess game is on screen.

3
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:17.987
Open the edge controls to select microphone narration, supported game audio, or both.

4
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.226
Enable the camera overlay during recording.

5
00:00:23.176 --> 00:00:26.548
The camera view is blurred here for privacy.

6
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:33.986
Switch to microphone only, mute, or enable both sources again, without ending the recording.

7
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.682
Android shows an ongoing recording notification.

8
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.309
Return to the game and keep recording.

9
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.846
Recordly.

10
00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:50.794
Screen, audio, and camera controls within reach.
